      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i hear you. but what if i switched to a different kind? i saw some people saying that things like 5-HTP or even just taking extra vitamin D is way more \"natural\" and won't mess with my hormones like that. would it be totally safe for me to just try 5-HTP instead since it's just a supplement? i really need something to help with the blues right now.",
